#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Rebuild the FULL 73-ticker canonical scenario-CAGR book from the ratified SOURCE_UPDATE bundle.

Assembles the canonical AUGMENTED workbook: CAGRs/betas/deltas carried VERBATIM from the ratified
bundle (byte-identical to canonical) and SELF-VERIFIED via
    CAGR%_{t,s} = RF%_s + SUMPRODUCT(beta_t, premia%_s) + 12*alpha%_t + delta%_{t,s}
(recompute vs carried agrees to <1bp). Does NOT re-fit: live-CSV re-fit drifts ~10mo past the ratified
vintage; recomputing from 4dp-stored betas cannot reproduce every 2dp rounding. Premia + scenarios
embedded as fixed inputs -> depends only on the ratified bundle CSVs."""
